{
  "id": "unique-event-031",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#31 - grabbed!\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1710,1725]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you lean to pick up the object,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1725,1760]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a couple of dirty, clawed hands\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1760,1792]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rise from the ground. Roll d6.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1792,1823]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1) The hands catch your neck and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1823,1856]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "begin to strangle you. Make a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1856,1886]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "L4 strength save to break free.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1886,1918]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Add +1 if you have the Strong",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[90,1918,1947]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skill and +2 if you have Strong\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,22,54]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(Expert). Roll until you break\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,54,85]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "free. Every unsuccessful\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,85,110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attempt costs you 1 Life. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,110,140]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "manage to pick up the object\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,140,169]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "if you survive.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,169,185]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2) The hands grab a carried\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,185,213]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "object and then disappear.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,213,240]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Cross 1 object of your choice\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,240,270]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "off your play sheet.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,270,291]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3) The hands claw at you,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,291,317]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "inflicting 1 Life on a failed\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,317,347]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Defense roll against a L5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,347,373]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attack, and then disappear.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,373,401]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4) The hands  wave  in front of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,401,433]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your eyes and disappear.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,433,458]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5) The hands miss you and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,458,484]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disappear.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,484,495]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6) The hands grab your clothes\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,495,526]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "but you manage to cut away\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,526,553]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the right hand. The hand falls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,553,584]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to the ground as the rest of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,584,617]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "arms disappear. If you have an\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,617,648]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "occult guide and a candle, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,648,679]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may build a Hand of Glory (go\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,679,709]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-031:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to #33).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[91,709,718]]"
    }
  ],
